#: freestringsunit.rs_hydrodin_task1_note
#| msgid ""
#| "AT   - Transverse projected wind area [m2];\n"
#| "S    - Length of perimeter of lateral projection, excluding WL and slender bodies;\n"
#| "C    - Distance from bow to centroid of lateral projected area (m);\n"
#| "M    - Number of distinct groups of masts or king posts;\n"
#| "1.2.1   Number of groups of masts M:\n"
#| "1  - Passenger ships and ferries;\n"
#| "2  - Cargo ships with engines amidships, load;\n"
#| "3  - Cargo ships with engines amidships, ballast;\n"
#| "4  - Cargo ships with engines aft, load;\n"
#| "5  - Cargo ships with engines aft, ballast;\n"
#| "6  - Tankers and ore carriers with bridge amidships, load;\n"
#| "7  - Tankers and ore carriers with bridge amidships, ballast;\n"
#| "8  - Tankers and ore carriers with bridge aft, load;\n"
#| "9  - Tankers and ore carriers with bridge aft, ballast;\n"
#| "10 - Stern trawlers;\n"
#| "11 - Tugs;\n"
#| "12 - Tankers, bulkcariers, cargo ships with engines aft;\n"
#| "13 - Passenger ships, ferries, container ships with cargo on deck;\n"
#| "14 - Lichter ships with cargo on deck;\n"
#| "15 - Lichter ships with out cargo.\n"
#| "1.3    Output data:\n"
#| "Cx = Fx/(0.5*RHOA*Vr^2*AT)+-1.96*Stand_Err(X)    - longitudinal force coefficient;\n"
#| "Cy = Fy/(0.5*RHOA*Vr^2*AT)+-1.96*Stand_Err(Y)    - lateral force coefficient;\n"
#| "Cmz= Mz/(0.5*RHOA*Vr^2*AT*SLOA)+-1.96*Stand_Err(Mz) - yawing moment coefficient,\n"
#| "RHOA - density of air;\n"
#| "Vr   - RMS of relative wind speed between water level and top of superstructure."
msgid ""
"Program of aerodynamics characteristics calculation for merchant ships.\n"
"1.1   This wind resistance prediction method in this program has been described by:\n"
"1.1.1 R.M.Isherwood, \"Wind  Resistance of  Merchant  Ships\", Proceedings  of  Royal\n"
"Institution of Naval Architects, 1973.\n"
"1.2   Needed input data parameters:\n"
"SLOA - Length overall [m];\n"
"B    - Beam [m];\n"
"AL   - Lateral projected wind area [m2];\n"
"AS   - Lateral projected area of superstructure [m2];\n"
"AT   - Transverse projected wind area [m2];\n"
"S    - Length of perimeter of lateral projection, excluding WL and slender bodies;\n"
"C    - Distance from bow to centroid of lateral projected area (m);\n"
"M    - Number of distinct groups of masts or king posts;\n"
"1.2.1   Number of groups of masts M:\n"
"1  - Passenger ships and ferries;\n"
"2  - Cargo ships with engines amidships, load;\n"
"3  - Cargo ships with engines amidships, ballast;\n"
"4  - Cargo ships with engines aft, load;\n"
"5  - Cargo ships with engines aft, ballast;\n"
"6  - Tankers and ore carriers with bridge amidships, load;\n"
"7  - Tankers and ore carriers with bridge amidships, ballast;\n"
"8  - Tankers and ore carriers with bridge aft, load;\n"
"9  - Tankers and ore carriers with bridge aft, ballast;\n"
"10 - Stern trawlers;\n"
"11 - Tugs;\n"
"12 - Tankers, bulkcariers, cargo ships with engines aft;\n"
"13 - Passenger ships, ferries, container ships with cargo on deck;\n"
"14 - Lichter ships with cargo on deck;\n"
"15 - Lichter ships with out cargo.\n"
"1.3    Output data:\n"
"Cx = Fx/(0.5*RHOA*Vr^2*AT)+-1.96*Stand_Err(X)    - longitudinal force coefficient;\n"
"Cy = Fy/(0.5*RHOA*Vr^2*AT)+-1.96*Stand_Err(Y)    - lateral force coefficient;\n"
"Cmz= Mz/(0.5*RHOA*Vr^2*AT*SLOA)+-1.96*Stand_Err(Mz) - yawing moment coefficient,\n"
"RHOA - density of air;\n"
"Vr   - RMS of relative wind speed between water level and top of superstructure"
msgstr ""
"Programa de cálculo de características aerodinámicas para buques mercantes.\n"
"1.1   El método de predicción de la resistencia al viento de este programa ha sido descrito por:\n"
"1.1.1 R.M.Isherwood, \"Wind  Resistance of  Merchant  Ships\", Proceedings  of  Royal\n"
"Institution of Naval Architects, 1973.\n"
"1.2   Parámetros de datos de entrada necesarios:\n"
"SLOA - Eslora total [m];\n"
"B    - Manga [m];\n"
"AL   - Área lateral proyectada al viento [m2];\n"
"AS   - Área lateral proyectada de la superestructura [m2];\n"
"AT   - Área transversal proyectada al viento [m2];\n"
"S    - Longitud del perímetro de la proyección lateral, excluyendo la línea de flotación y los cuerpos esbeltos;\n"
"C    - Distancia desde la proa al centroide del área lateral proyectada (m);\n"
"M    - Número de grupos distintos de palos o postes de carga;\n"
"1.2.1   Número de grupos de palos M:\n"
"1  - Buques de pasaje y ferris;\n"
"2  - Buques de carga con máquinas en el centro, cargados;\n"
"3  - Buques de carga con máquinas en el centro, en lastre;\n"
"4  - Buques de carga con máquinas a popa, cargados;\n"
"5  - Buques de carga con máquinas a popa, en lastre;\n"
"6  - Petroleros y mineraleros con puente en el centro, cargados;\n"
"7  - Petroleros y mineraleros con puente en el centro, en lastre;\n"
"8  - Petroleros y mineraleros con puente a popa, cargados;\n"
"9  - Petroleros y mineraleros con puente a popa, en lastre;\n"
"10 - Arrastreros de popa;\n"
"11 - Remolcadores;\n"
"12 - Petroleros, graneleros, buques de carga con máquinas a popa;\n"
"13 - Buques de pasaje, ferris, portacontenedores con carga sobre cubierta;\n"
"14 - Gabarras con carga sobre cubierta;\n"
"15 - Gabarras sin carga.\n"
"1.3    Datos de salida:\n"
"Cx = Fx/(0.5*RHOA*Vr^2*AT)+-1.96*Stand_Err(X)    - coeficiente de fuerza longitudinal;\n"
"Cy = Fy/(0.5*RHOA*Vr^2*AT)+-1.96*Stand_Err(Y)    - coeficiente de fuerza lateral;\n"
"Cmz= Mz/(0.5*RHOA*Vr^2*AT*SLOA)+-1.96*Stand_Err(Mz) - coeficiente de momento de guiñada,\n"
"RHOA - densidad del aire;\n"
"Vr   - valor eficaz de la velocidad relativa del viento entre el nivel del agua y la parte superior de la superestructura"

